683
00:49:42.938 --> 00:49:44.022
Hei, Hui-jin.

684
00:49:44.898 --> 00:49:47.067
saya? Saya sejuk, sudah tentu.

685
00:49:47.567 --> 00:49:49.695
Adakah anda mendengar buzz tentang hari cuti kami?

